  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CO-Lead implement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam in Cambodia (OiC) will lead deliver the project activities in collaboration with FNN as local NGO partner through sub-grant agreement from Oxfam.
Moreover, Oxfam will work in close collaborate with DAI, DPS, DACP of MAFF to on the contents of policy and framework related to contract farming and conflict resolution mechanism as well as conflict prevention in contract farming scheme.
FNN:will be responsible to carry out the activities of piloting the grievance mechanism guideline. FNN will work with DAI and select ACs who are the members of FNN. FNN will also work closely with Oxfam who lead on developing the grievance mechanism guideline.</narrative>
  </description>
